---
const features = [
  ['01', 'Un solo beat', 'Una fuente de audio. Todos los autos. La misma canción, al mismo tiempo.'],
  ['02', 'Sin internet', 'La red vive en el estacionamiento, así que la sesión sigue aunque no haya señal.'],
  ['03', 'Hecho para probar', 'Arrancamos con AUX para medir sincronización antes de complicar el hardware.']
];
const names = ['SyncRide', 'Convoy', 'PulsePark'];
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="es">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <meta name="description" content="SyncRide sincroniza música entre varios autos estacionados para que todos compartan el mismo beat." />
    <title>SyncRide — Un solo beat, todos los autos</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <header class="nav shell">
      <a class="brand" href="#top" aria-label="SyncRide, inicio"><span class="mark"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span>Sync<b>Ride</b></span></a>
      <nav><a href="#como-funciona">Cómo funciona</a><a href="#mvp">MVP</a><a href="#nombre">El nombre</a></nav>
      <a class="nav-cta" href="#espera">Quiero probarlo <b>↗</b></a>
    </header>

    <main id="top">
      <section class="hero shell">
        <div class="hero-copy"><p class="eyebrow"><span class="dot"></span>Proyecto en prototipo</p><h1>Un solo beat.<br /><em>Todos los autos.</em></h1><p class="lede">SyncRide convierte un estacionamiento en un sistema de sonido compartido. Música sincronizada entre varios carros, sin pelearte con el Bluetooth.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button" href="#como-funciona">Conoce el concepto <b>↓</b></a><a class="text-link" href="#mvp">Ver el MVP <b>↗</b></a></div><div class="proof"><span></span>Diseñado para sesiones con amigos, empezando por AUX.</div></div>
        <div class="hero-visual"><div class="image-frame"><img src="/hero-cars.png" alt="Tres autos estacionados conectados por una misma señal de música" /><div class="caption"><i></i><span>shared session</span><strong>03 cars connected</strong></div></div><div class="orbit one"></div><div class="orbit two"></div></div>
      </section>

      <section class="signal shell"><div><strong>05 ms</strong><span>meta de diferencia</span></div><div><strong>30 min</strong><span>sesión sin cortes</span></div><div><strong>100%</strong><span>red local</span></div><div class="signal-note">↗ &nbsp; La fiesta no debería depender<br />de quién tiene mejor señal.</div></section>

      <section class="story shell" id="como-funciona"><div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">La idea</p><h2>De una fuente de audio<br /><span>a una misma experiencia.</span></h2></div><div class="features">{features.map(([num, title, text]) => <article><small>{num}</small><h3>{title}</h3><p>{text}</p></article>)}</div></section>

      <section class="system shell" id="mvp"><div class="system-copy"><p class="eyebrow">El primer experimento</p><h2>Menos promesas.<br /><span>Más pruebas.</span></h2><p>El MVP usa una Raspberry Pi como servidor y un receptor compacto por auto. Primero comprobamos que el audio llegue sincronizado; después hacemos el sistema más cómodo.</p><a class="text-link" href="#espera">Sigue el progreso <b>↗</b></a></div><div class="diagram" aria-label="Fuente de audio a Raspberry Pi y tres receptores AUX"><div class="node"><i>♫</i><small>FUENTE</small><strong>Tu música</strong></div><div class="connector"></div><div class="node server"><i>✦</i><small>SERVIDOR LOCAL</small><strong>Raspberry Pi</strong></div><div class="receivers">{['A','B','C'].map((letter, index) => <div><i>{letter}</i><small>RECEPTOR</small><strong>Auto 0{index + 1}</strong><b></b></div>)}</div><footer>● Wi‑Fi local · salida AUX</footer></div></section>

      <section class="name-section shell" id="nombre"><div><p class="eyebrow">Identidad provisional</p><h2>El hardware ya tiene dirección.<br /><span>El nombre todavía está abierto.</span></h2></div><div class="name-copy"><p>“MusicShare” explica la idea, pero se siente genérico. Estas opciones apuntan más a la experiencia: movimiento, energía y conexión entre autos.</p><div class="names">{names.map((name, index) => <span class:list={{ selected: index === 0 }}>{name}{index === 0 && <small>favorito</small>}</span>)}</div></div></section>

      <section class="waitlist shell" id="espera"><div><p class="eyebrow">Construyámoslo juntos</p><h2>¿Quieres ver cuando<br /><em>suene el primer beat?</em></h2></div><form><label for="email">Déjanos tu correo</label><div><input id="email" type="email" placeholder="tu@correo.com" /><button type="submit">Avísame ↗</button></div><small>Sin spam. Solo avances del prototipo.</small></form></section>
    </main>
    <footer class="footer shell"><a class="brand" href="#top"><span class="mark"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span>Sync<b>Ride</b></span></a><p>Un experimento para que todos escuchen lo mismo.</p><small>© 2026 · built in the parking lot</small></footer>
  </body>
</html>

<style>
@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Mono:wght@400;500&family=Manrope:wght@400;500;600;700;800&family=Space+Grotesk:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap');
:root{--bg:#0b0c13;--ink:#f2efe9;--muted:#a8a7b0;--line:#262631;--violet:#8b76ff;--lime:#c8f36a;--orange:#f18a5c}*{box-sizing:border-box}html{scroll-behavior:smooth}body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font-family:Manrope,system-ui,sans-serif}a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}.shell{width:min(1160px,calc(100% - 64px));margin:auto}.nav{height:90px;display:flex;align-items:center;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font:600 20px/1 'Space Grotesk';letter-spacing:-.05em}.brand b{color:var(--violet)}.mark{display:flex;align-items:end;gap:3px;height:20px}.mark i{display:block;width:4px;background:var(--lime);border-radius:4px}.mark i:nth-child(1){height:9px}.mark i:nth-child(2){height:16px}.mark i:nth-child(3){height:12px;background:var(--violet)}nav{display:flex;gap:31px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:42px;color:var(--muted);font-size:12px}nav a:hover,.text-link:hover{color:var(--lime)}.nav-cta{font-size:12px;font-weight:700}.nav-cta b,.text-link b{color:var(--lime);font-size:17px;margin-left:5px}.hero{min-height:610px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:49% 51%;align-items:center;padding:76px 0 84px}.eyebrow{font:500 10px/1 'DM Mono';letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--lime);margin:0 0 26px}.dot{display:inline-block;width:7px;height:7px;background:var(--lime);border-radius:50%;margin-right:9px;box-shadow:0 0 15px var(--lime)}h1,h2,h3,p{margin-top:0}h1{font:600 clamp(55px,6.3vw,88px)/.96 'Space Grotesk';letter-spacing:-.075em;margin-bottom:29px}h1 em,h2 span{font-style:normal;color:var(--violet)}.lede{max-width:430px;color:var(--muted);font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;margin-bottom:36px}.actions{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:28px}.button{display:inline-flex;gap:28px;padding:15px 18px;background:var(--lime);color:#14151a;border-radius:3px;font-size:12px;font-weight:700}.button b{font-size:16px}.text-link{font-size:12px;font-weight:700}.proof{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;margin-top:54px;color:#73737f;font:10px 'DM Mono';line-height:1.5}.proof span{width:35px;height:1px;background:var(--violet)}.hero-visual{position:relative}.image-frame{position:relative;overflow:hidden;aspect-ratio:1.1;background:#1d1d2b}.image-frame:after{content:'';position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(11,12,19,.5),transparent 55%),linear-gradient(0deg,rgba(11,12,19,.75),transparent 45%)}.image-frame img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover}.caption{position:absolute;z-index:1;bottom:21px;left:24px;right:24px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font:10px 'DM Mono';color:#c8c4ca}.caption strong{margin-left:auto;color:var(--ink);font-weight:400}.caption i{width:6px;height:6px;background:var(--orange);border-radius:50%;box-shadow:0 0 12px var(--orange)}.orbit{position:absolute;border:1px solid #463d78;border-radius:50%;pointer-events:none}.orbit.one{width:240px;height:240px;right:-100px;top:-130px}.orbit.two{width:170px;height:170px;left:-80px;bottom:-80px;border-color:#536536}.signal{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr) 1.65fr;border-top:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding:23px 0}.signal>div{padding-left:22px;border-left:1px solid var(--line);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:5px}.signal>div:first-child{border-left:0;padding-left:0}.signal strong{font:500 27px 'Space Grotesk';letter-spacing:-.06em}.signal span,.signal-note{font:10px 'DM Mono';color:#777681;text-transform:uppercase}.signal-note{text-align:right;justify-content:center;line-height:1.5}.story{padding:145px 0 150px}.section-heading{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:end;margin-bottom:60px}.section-heading .eyebrow{width:33%;margin:0}.section-heading h2,.system h2,.name-section h2{font:500 clamp(35px,4vw,54px)/1.04 'Space Grotesk';letter-spacing:-.065em;margin:0}.features{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);border-top:1px solid var(--line)}.features article{padding:27px 24px 0 0;border-right:1px solid var(--line);margin-right:24px}.features article:last-child{border:0;margin:0}.features small{font:10px 'DM Mono';color:var(--violet)}.features h3{font:500 23px 'Space Grotesk';margin:47px 0 12px;letter-spacing:-.04em}.features p,.system-copy>p,.name-copy>p{font-size:13px;line-height:1.75;color:var(--muted);max-width:280px}.system{display:grid;grid-template-columns:40% 60%;gap:40px;padding:80px 0 140px;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}.system-copy>p{margin:30px 0 28px}.diagram{background:#12131d;border:1px solid var(--line);padding:32px 34px 25px;min-height:355px}.node{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}.node i,.receivers>div>i{display:grid;place-items:center;width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--violet);font-style:normal}.node small,.receivers small{font:9px 'DM Mono';color:#7d7b89}.node strong{font:500 13px 'Space Grotesk';margin-left:auto}.server i{background:var(--lime);color:#1b1c20}.connector{height:44px;border-left:1px dashed #6258ab;margin-left:16px}.receivers{border-top:1px dashed #3b3b50;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:18px;padding-top:24px}.receivers>div{display:grid;grid-template-columns:26px 1fr;gap:7px 9px;align-items:center}.receivers>div>i{width:26px;height:26px;background:transparent;border:1px solid var(--violet);font:10px 'DM Mono';grid-row:span 2}.receivers strong{font:500 12px 'Space Grotesk'}.receivers b{grid-column:2;width:100%;height:2px;background:var(--lime);box-shadow:0 0 9px #c8f36a}.diagram footer{margin-top:43px;text-align:right;font:9px 'DM Mono';color:#706f7d}.diagram footer:first-letter{color:var(--orange)}.name-section{display:grid;grid-template-columns:50% 50%;padding:94px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.name-section h2{font-size:39px}.name-copy{padding-left:15%}.name-copy>p{max-width:370px;margin-bottom:25px}.names{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px}.names>span{padding:9px 13px;border:1px solid var(--line);font:12px 'DM Mono';color:#9896a2}.names .selected{border-color:var(--lime);color:var(--lime)}.names small{font-size:8px;margin-left:8px;color:#7c7b86}.waitlist{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:110px 62px;margin-top:0;background:var(--violet);color:#13131c}.waitlist .eyebrow{color:#2e265f;margin-bottom:18px}.waitlist h2{font:500 43px/1 'Space Grotesk';letter-spacing:-.06em;margin:0}.waitlist h2 em{font-style:normal;color:#e1dfff}.waitlist form{width:38%}.waitlist label{display:block;font:10px 'DM Mono';text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:10px;color:#ddd8ff}.waitlist form div{display:flex;border-bottom:1px solid #50458b}.waitlist input{width:100%;padding:12px 0;border:0;background:transparent;outline:0;font:13px Manrope}.waitlist input::placeholder{color:#50458b}.waitlist button{border:0;background:transparent;font:700 12px Manrope;cursor:pointer}.waitlist form small{display:block;margin-top:10px;font:9px 'DM Mono';color:#d7d0ff}.footer{display:flex;align-items:center;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:28px 0 40px}.footer p,.footer>small{font:9px 'DM Mono';color:#767580;margin:0 0 0 26px}.footer>small{margin-left:auto}@media(max-width:760px){.shell{width:min(100% - 40px,560px)}.nav{height:73px}.nav nav,.nav-cta{display:none}.hero{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:stretch;padding:67px 0 56px;gap:52px}.hero-visual{width:calc(100% + 20px);margin-left:-10px}.lede{font-size:14px}.signal{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:15px}.signal>div{padding-left:10px}.signal strong{font-size:22px}.signal-note{display:none}.story{padding:92px 0}.section-heading{display:block;margin-bottom:40px}.section-heading .eyebrow{width:auto;margin-bottom:28px}.features{display:block}.features article{border-right:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding:25px 0;margin:0}.features h3{margin:25px 0 9px}.system,.name-section{display:block;padding:70px 0}.diagram{margin-top:52px;padding:26px 18px 25px}.receivers{gap:8px}.receivers strong{font-size:10px}.name-section h2{font-size:33px}.name-copy{padding:38px 0 0}.waitlist{display:block;padding:36px 26px;margin-top:70px}.waitlist h2{font-size:34px}.waitlist form{width:100%;margin-top:42px}.footer{display:block}.footer p{margin:22px 0}.footer>small{display:block;margin:0}}
</style>
